{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q7041506","formula":"C₂₇H₃₅N₉O₅S₂","hill":"C27H35N9O5S2","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":27.0,"H":35.0,"N":9.0,"O":5.0,"S":2.0},"names":{"en":"Nitrosoprodenafil"},"descriptions":{"en":"Nitrosoprodenafil is a synthetic designer drug found in \"herbal\" aphrodisiac products, which is a novel nitrosated analogue of sildenafil (Viagra). It has an innovative structure which acts as a prodrug, breaking down in the body to release both the PDE5 inhibitor aildenafil as well as free nitric oxide, which have powerfully synergistic effects. This dual mechanism of action has never been exploited by conventional pharmaceutical companies because of the risks involved; usually combining PDE5 inhibitors with nitric oxide releasers like amyl nitrite is contraindicated as it can cause a precipitous drop in blood pressure that can potentially result in death."},"fame":4,"pubchemCid":73425531,"mass":629.8,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCCC1=NN(C2=C1N=C(N=C2OC3=NC=C(S3)N(C)N=O)C4=C(C=CC(=C4)S(=O)(=O)N5C[C@H](N[C@H](C5)C)C)OCC)C","inchikey":"DTAKXJYYAUWRND-CALCHBBNSA-N","iupac":"N-[2-[5-[5-[(3S,5R)-3,5-dimethylpiperazin-1-yl]sulfonyl-2-ethoxyphenyl]-1-methyl-3-propylpyrazolo[4,5-d]pyrimidin-7-yl]oxy-1,3-thiazol-5-yl]-N-methylnitrous amide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"73425531","atoms":78,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-4.31,"y":-5.176,"z":0.122,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.23,"y":-5.78,"z":1.517,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.988,"y":-5.342,"z":2.297,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.988,"y":-3.895,"z":2.656,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.774,"y":-3.437,"z":3.645,"el":"N"},{"x":-3.524,"y":-2.111,"z":3.667,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.595,"y":-1.711,"z":2.752,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.227,"y":-2.855,"z":2.067,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.332,"y":-2.862,"z":1.054,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.796,"y